1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,707
Wall push-ups.

2
00:00:01,707 --> 00:00:02,845
They make pushing doors

3
00:00:02,845 --> 00:00:04,550
and lifting bags easier.

4
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:05,831
Stand about an arm's

5
00:00:05,831 --> 00:00:07,166
length from the wall.

6
00:00:07,166 --> 00:00:08,141
Hands flat,

7
00:00:08,141 --> 00:00:09,350
at shoulder height.

8
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:10,259
Start by standing

9
00:00:10,259 --> 00:00:11,641
a little closer.

10
00:00:11,641 --> 00:00:12,558
Bend your elbows

11
00:00:12,558 --> 00:00:13,887
just a bit.

12
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:14,966
Bring your chest

13
00:00:14,966 --> 00:00:15,883
toward the wall…

14
00:00:15,883 --> 00:00:17,526
and press back.

15
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,021
Keep your body straight,

16
00:00:20,021 --> 00:00:20,555
like a plank

17
00:00:20,555 --> 00:00:21,733
of wood.

18
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:31,498
Want more?

19
00:00:31,498 --> 00:00:32,137
Step your feet

20
00:00:32,137 --> 00:00:33,408
back a little.

